# www → apex redirect is handled by middleware.ts (Workers _redirects requires relative paths only)
#
# Legacy webpack chunk paths — a previous build emitted dynamic-route chunks
# under bracket dirs (`[state]`, `[city]`). Browsers with stale runtimes
# still request the URL-encoded form. Redirect those to the renamed
# underscore dirs so old tabs don't ChunkLoadError.
#
# IMPORTANT: only match the URL-encoded form (`%5B…%5D`). Literal brackets
# in `_redirects` source patterns are treated as named-wildcard placeholders
# by Cloudflare, which would match `_state_` itself and cause an infinite
# redirect loop.
/_next/static/chunks/app/state/%5Bstate%5D/* /_next/static/chunks/app/state/_state_/:splat 301
/_next/static/chunks/app/city/%5Bcity%5D/* /_next/static/chunks/app/city/_city_/:splat 301
